625244c3a010f000181b2f4a,Many young people today spend too much time following the latest fashion trends in areas such as clothing and technology. To what extent do you agree or disagree?,"Many young people today spend too much time following the latest fashion trends in areas such as clothing and technology.

To what extent do you agree or disagree?

 

In this present day and age , the younger generation utterly appeals to the latest fashion and technology. Accordingly , there has been much discussion revolving around the issue of whether youth should spend too much time or not . In my perspective , I partially agree with that statement , and this essay will seek to examine the complex issue.

Nowadays, obviously, teenagers pay too much attention on clothing and electronic devices. Due to successive waves of globalization , it is very easy to imitate wearing styles , and up-to-date technological devices become abundant . To have an upper hand  and not to be left behind , many young people have an eye for latest trends . More specifically, when they visit foreign countries ,  knowing the current trend literally benefits to them . They are no longer underestimated and can easily get cultural adaptation. Undoubtedly , to a certain extent , youngsters should spend time on contemporary matters.

Admittedly , devoting too much time on modern things is  some kind of wasting their precious time. Nonetheless , those updated trends could not guarantee for life long career goal and they can make use of time on education or career advancement. In addition, most young people follow up trendy things in order to flaunt .Some even sacrifice their life and are misled by those latest concerns.

Having both sides of facts considered , both bright and dark sides occupy each face of this issue . By and large , individuals have the privilege to administer themselves .As the extremity is not good in life , I partly agree with this view and youth should spend their valuable time in a sensible way.",4.0,4.0,4.0,4.0,4.0,chillies/ielts-writing-task2-essays,Art,291,4d7b44bbc4aa72ab,prompt_copied_at_start
6323eda6aac8660018fa57e2,Many young people today spend too much time following the latest fashion trends in areas such as clothing and technology. To what extent do you agree or disagree?,"Clothing and technological advancements taking place today are at an all-time high. People opine that the youth spend a lot  of their time keeping up to date with the clothing and technology trends unlike in the past. I strongly agree with the popular opinion and will provide reasons and examples in support of this statement.

The apparel industry is ever-growing and ever-changing. In order to impress their friends and look cool, present youth are eager to follow the latest fashion trends in clothing such as short pants, stylish jeans, message-based T-shirts, etc. and do not care if they spend a considerable amount of time on them. In a recent article on shopping, youth spend around 3 hours daily on e-shopping apps like Myntra and Shein. Moreover, they hardly use clothes for 3 or more months and go shopping whenever anything new arrives in the market.

The fashion craze is not only restricted to clothing but has also leapt into technology. They want to keep up to date with the latest  gadgets such as phones, bio-watches, laptops and so on. The previous generation used to buy mobile phones chosen by their parents without giving much thought to the specifications. On the contrary, today's youngsters want to check out each and every feature that a phone offers, compare different brands, pricing, etc. before making a purchase decision even if the whole process is time-consuming. For instance, one of my friends recently bought an I-phone after thoroughly weighing the other options and spent nearly 4 hours at the Apple Store. 

To summarize, without any doubt, I believe that today's generation spends a lot of time keeping up with the latest fashion trends in clothes as well as gadgets.  In order to look impressive in society and compete with their peers, they spend a considerable amount of time keeping pace with recent fashion trends. With the ease of shopping and regularly emerging products, this behaviour is here to stay.",8.0,7.0,7.0,8.0,9.0,chillies/ielts-writing-task2-essays,Art,325,4d7b44bbc4aa72ab,
62610b46bf0f3600197c93b3,Many young people today spend too much time following the latest fashion trends in areas such as clothing and technology. To what extent do you agree or disagree?,"In recent times, many young people have spent a lot of time on fashion trends such as clothing and technology.So they have to spend so much time and money on these. In my opinion, I partly agree with this idea. This essay aims to highlight this view.

For starters, people should recognize the fact that People are willing to pour  a huge amount of their money and time running after the latest style of fashion trends or technology without any reason. To improve my point, many young or Teenagers often imitate the way  their idols dress. They change clothes constantly and sometimes wear it a extreme styles. Or try to own the newest version of technology devices such as Iphone or Tablets. They are pay too much attention on appearance and materialism values. Several years ago, a chinese young man was in line up to all nigh to buy the newest iphone model without any concerning about his healthy.

On the other hand, there are some reasons against these trends. It is important to remember that it would be wrong if we have all the young people who follow this phenomenon. In order words they are cutting back all unnecessary things and choose items that are less worth but be needded..

To sum up, it is therefore safe to say that all the given factors have created a horns of dilemma when people discuss the impacts of the problems. However, in my point of view, I am quite in favor of the idea saying that young people have spent so much time and money on clothes and gadgets trends. Thus each of us should consider carefully before reaching the final decision on this issue.",4.5,4.0,6.0,4.0,4.0,chillies/ielts-writing-task2-essays,Art,285,4d7b44bbc4aa72ab,
5e6ae037fcf42e0018cc719f,"Some people think that one good way to promote world peace is through international sporting events, while others think that it is not. To what extent do you agree or disagree?","It is thought by some people that international sporting events are an effective medium of promoting world peace, while other people think that it is a waste of time and money. In my opinion, I agree that International sporting events, promote peace by bringing all the countries of the world on one stage and bringing cultures together.

Firstly, in international sporting events, all the countries of the world participate and come together on the same stage. In other words, all the countries compete in these events irrespective of their geographical, economical and political differences. The best example of an international sporting event in the Olympics. In the Olympics, all the athletes and the representatives of the world meet and greet each other. This brings harmony among the nations which leads to an overall truce in the world. 

Secondly, international sporting events increase international reconciliation by encouraging people to travel to different countries and making them by understanding their culture, heritage, and religion. As these events take place in different countries,  people travel to the hosting country to cheer and celebrate their country's team. Consequently, people understand the culture, tradition, history, and language of the organizing country. This promotes globalization, leading to a better understanding among people.

Finally, international events lead to world accord by providing funds to countries in calamities or natural disasters. The international events are organized by global committees which also raise funds through these events to help countries in need. This strengthens the bond between the countries, thus improving their relations.

In conclusion, in my opinion, international sporting events bring countries together at a stage where they meet, discuss and help each other, which in turn leads to world peace.",6.5,7.0,7.0,6.0,6.0,chillies/ielts-writing-task2-essays,Globalization and Consumerism,283,570c950fad1b361d,
615a4edf4ba3dc0012fe424b,"Many governments think that economic progress is their most important goal. Some people, however, think that other types of progress are equally important for a country. Discuss both these views and give your own opinion. Give reasons for your answer and include any relevant examples from your own knowledge or experience.","Currently, there are different points of view about which type of the progress is more essential. Although states consider that economy is more important, there are those who believe that progress concerning other fields worth attention equally. In this essay, I will discuss both opinions and provide my own view on this subject.

   To begin with, the governments argue that economy plays a significant role in the countries' development and concerns many aspects of people's lives. In other words, the improvment in the economical area may lead to positive consequences, such as an increase in number of facilities and providing more workplaces. For example, if the states have enough money, they will probably be able to set up many buildings, such as sports centers, malls, galleries, restaurants and so on. Besides, a construction of many organizations cause to the fact that there are many positions will become available. 

   On the other hand, some people think that progress should be also in other areas. Firstly, it can concern education, which has impact on the society and their development. It is often considered that literacy contributes to the more capable and effective nation. For instance, in my homeland, the government provided citizens an opportunity to be well-educated. As a result, a lot of them brought benefits in different fields, beggining with science, and ending with trade. Secondly, technological progress can also have many advantages. As an example, the Internet is one of the invention that completely changed the society. People can find almost any information they need and become more educationally gifted. Moreover, doctors can create more efficient medicines thanks to the particular gadgets.

   In conlusion, although the positive sides that economic progress has, I think that there are other improvements, which should be done also.",5.5,9.0,4.0,4.0,4.0,chillies/ielts-writing-task2-essays,Business and Companies,294,211e962c5d94e44d,
