On the other hand, heading to new nation can bring many social and practical problems. Firstly, to get a job would be very difficult . In other words, getting new job in an unknown society is too hard. Also, that moment, he or she has to learn new language as he belongs to that culture. Span, take as an example, people carry their work in spanish language that is why learning spanish would be main job for new comer. Furthermore, making new friend is an another demerit. People generally do not make friend if someone does not speak properly in their language.

