 Immigrants might have some communication problems due to the different call the different cultures that the local people and the new ones might have. When they tend to communicate in different ways, so they cannot connect together. As a result, they tend to be alone in a new country. For example, the rule of connecting is having  dinner together in Iran even though it might be having a little chat out of the house in America. To sum up two families from these countries can not communicate together. 

