Although it would produce several social problems, it might become easy to live in a foreign country after sometimes people tend to learn their culture and the way of living around others in. They are all humans, so they like to respect each other after finding some information about that place. Also, local people would be nice together either. For instance, students in school might Have a kind of unhappy atmosphere at school in the beginning but after they talked to each other and know something about each other, they would become friends.

