6132f68e2b4348001866d90b,Living in a country where you have to speak a foreign language can cause serious social problems as well as practical problems To what extent do you agree or disagree with this statement,"The two maps illustrate road access to a city hospital in the year 2007 and how it has developed in 2010.

Overall, there has been a larger infrastructure development in 2010, and number of advanced features have been added around the city hospital while remaining the location of the hospital as it was.

